157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (The Mini Search Engine is a software application designed to search and retrieve relevant information from a collection of documents efficiently. It uses Data Structures and Algorithms \(DSA\) such as HashMaps and Inverted Indexes to organize data and improve search speed. The system processes user queries, matches keywords with indexed documents, and displays accurate results quickly. This project demonstrates the practical application of DSA concepts in information retrieval. It reduces search time, improves efficiency, and provides a simple understanding of how modern search engines work. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
